{"title":"Niagara Falls Road Trip: André-Philippe Gagnon . $50,includes ticket & transport","startsAt":"2026-10-28T16:30:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-28T23:45:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"# 🎤 Niagara Falls Road Trip: André-Philippe Gagnon – Greatest Hits\n\n📅 **Wednesday, October 28, 2026**\n📍 **Meet at Christie Station, Toronto**\n🚗 **Travel in a Kia Soul with SiriusXM Radio**\n💰 **Just $50 TOTAL!**\n\nCome along for a fun evening road trip to Niagara Falls to see the incredible **André-Philippe Gagnon – Greatest Hits** at the **Avalon Theatre at Fallsview Casino Resort**!\nAndré-Philippe Gagnon is renowned for his musical impressions, comedy and ability to recreate the voices of some of the world's biggest musical stars. The Greatest Hits show takes audiences on a musical journey through the songs and artists that have created the soundtrack of our lives.\n\n### 🎟️ What's Included\n\n**$50 total includes:**\n\n* 🎫 Your concert ticket\n* 🚗 Round-trip transportation from **Christie Station**\n* 📻 A fun road trip in the **Kia Soul with SiriusXM**\n* 🌊 An evening in Niagara Falls\n\n### 🕓 Schedule\n\n**4:30 PM** – Depart Toronto from Christie Station\nWe'll head toward Niagara Falls after work. Depending on traffic and how quickly we get there, **we may have a little time to stop and do some sightseeing** before the show.\n\n**8:30 PM** – André-Philippe Gagnon: Greatest Hits\n📍 Avalon Theatre, Fallsview Casino Resort\n\nThe show is scheduled for **8:30 PM on Wednesday, October 28**.\n\n**After the show** – Head back to Toronto\n\n**Approximately 11:45 PM** – Expected arrival back at Christie Station, depending on traffic.\n\n### 🚨 VERY LIMITED SPOTS!\n\nThis is a **small-group road trip**, so there are only a very limited number of seats available in the Kia Soul.\n**Your spot is NOT confirmed until the $50 e-transfer is received.**\n\n💸 Send $50 by e-transfer to:\nnicolasbello@yahoo.com\n\nOnce your e-transfer is received, your spot will be locked in.\n\n### 🎭 Event Information\n\nThe show takes place at the **Avalon Theatre, 6380 Fallsview Boulevard, Niagara Falls**.\n👉 **Official event page:**\n[André-Philippe Gagnon – Fallsview Casino Resort](https://fallsviewcasinoresort.com/events-and-promotions/schedule-of-events/andre-philippe-gagnon.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n### ⚠️ Please Note\n\nThis is a **road trip**, not a bus tour.\n\nReturn times are approximate and can be affected by **Toronto traffic, QEW traffic and road conditions**.\n\nCome for the music, stay for the road-trip atmosphere, and let's make a night of it in Niagara Falls! 🎶🚗🌊","venue":{"name":"Christie Station Labyrinth","address":"Christie, 5 Christie St, Toronto, ON M6G 3B1, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.66399,"lng":-79.418724,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/c/c/3/5/highres_535972277.jpeg"}